<title>MALAYSIA: Gold Bridge year net 11.99 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Gold Bridge year net 11.99 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  11.99   vs	   8.75</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 69.65   vs	 110.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		   175.42   vs	 139.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    17.69   vs	  12.78</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	15.0    vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Gold Bridge Enginering &amp; Construction Bhd is a civil engineering and general contractor.</p>
